Desert Myrmex Resin Jelly'\n+added new cookbook entry - 'Jungle Myrmex Resin Jelly'\n+added recipe for cutting dragon hearts into flesh\n+added additional recipe for cloning lilies\n+added information from JEI mod about knives (based on information about Farmer's Delight knives)\n*changed cookbook entry - 'Troll Meat'\n*changed cookbook entry - 'Sea Serpent Meat'\n*changed cookbook entry - 'Shiny Chips'\n*cookbook now looks bigger in the item frame\n*cookbook texture has been fixed\n*raw mini pizza blank texture has been fixed\n*now all food/drinks that have effects can always be eaten/drank\n*myrmex resin cookies now have their own tooltips, where it says what kind they are made of\n*knives have been nerfed (reduced damage)\n*fixed the bug that after restarting the world, the flight from the 'Dragon's Flight' effect disappears\n*completely rewritten the code of the 'Dragon's Flight' effect\n*completely rewritten the 'Ice Aspect' effect\n*partially rewritten 'Cold Resistance' effect (IaF ice weapon attacks still work)\n*updated Brazilian Portuguese (pt_br) translation\n*updated Spanish (es_ar) translation\n*updated Chinese (zn_ch) translation",
